em_rollouts_onset/*
# ...except the dataset card, which is public-facing documentation. Untracked, it drifted
# out of sync with the repo unnoticed; version it so that cannot happen silently again.
# (Must be `dir/*` above, not `dir/` — git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded.)
!em_rollouts_onset/README.md

